Project Design Phase Phase
EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

Project Design Phase

1. Introduction

EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant designed to help students learn subjects in a simple, interactive, and personalized way. It uses Google Gemini to understand students' questions and provide explanations, examples, summaries, study materials, and learning support.

The Project Design Phase converts the requirements identified in the Requirement Analysis Phase into a clear technical and functional design for the EduGenie system.


---

2. Design Objectives

The main objectives of EduGenie are:

To provide personalized learning assistance.

To answer students' questions using AI.

To explain difficult topics in simple language.

To generate summaries and study notes.

To provide examples for better understanding.

To support different subjects and learning levels.

To provide an easy-to-use interface.

To use Google Gemini for intelligent responses.



