7. Data Flow Design

The basic data flow is:

Student enters question
          ↓
Frontend receives question
          ↓
Backend validates request
          ↓
Question sent to Gemini API
          ↓
Gemini processes the question
          ↓
AI response returned
          ↓
Backend sends response
          ↓
Response displayed to student


---

8. Technology Design

Component	Technology

Frontend	HTML, CSS, JavaScript / React
Backend	Python / Node.js
AI Model	Google Gemini
API	Gemini API
Database	MySQL / Firebase
Development Tool	VS Code
Version Control	GitHub


The exact technology stack can be adjusted according to the project implementation requirements.


