14. Conclusion

The Design Phase of EduGenie provides the technical blueprint for developing the Google Gemini-powered learning assistant. It defines the system architecture, modules, user interface, database structure, data flow, technology stack, security, and overall workflow. This design serves as the foundation for the next phase, where the actual development and implementation of EduGenie can begin.
